<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="page page-organizations">
    <%- include('partials/page-banner', {
        title,
        eyebrow: 'Partner Organizations',
        subtitle: 'Meet a few of the community-minded groups that trust Service Network to help them connect with volunteers and support local needs.',
        bannerClass: 'page-banner--organizations'
    }) %>

    <section class="content-intro">
        <h2>Organizations doing meaningful work</h2>
        <p class="lead">Our partners represent a range of causes and service models, but they share a common goal: creating stronger communities through consistent, people-centered work.</p>
        <p>These organizations rely on volunteers for everything from event support and mentoring to environmental care and neighborhood outreach.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="organization-grid">
        <article class="organization-card">
            <img src="/images/brightfuture-logo.png" alt="BrightFuture Builders logo">
            <h3>BrightFuture Builders</h3>
            <p>BrightFuture Builders supports students and families through after-school programs, practical mentorship, and educational outreach.</p>
            <p class="organization-meta">Focus areas: youth development, tutoring, and family support</p>
            <a href="mailto:info@brightfuture.org">info@brightfuture.org</a>
        </article>
        <article class="organization-card">
            <img src="/images/greenharvest-logo.png" alt="GreenHarvest Growers logo">
            <h3>GreenHarvest Growers</h3>
            <p>GreenHarvest Growers leads projects that promote sustainability, community gardening, and environmental stewardship.</p>
            <p class="organization-meta">Focus areas: green spaces, food access, and environmental education</p>
            <a href="mailto:contact@greenharvest.org">contact@greenharvest.org</a>
        </article>
        <article class="organization-card">
            <img src="/images/unityserve-logo.png" alt="UnityServe Volunteers logo">
            <h3>UnityServe Volunteers</h3>
            <p>UnityServe Volunteers coordinates neighborhood-based outreach that helps residents access practical support and shared community resources.</p>
            <p class="organization-meta">Focus areas: community outreach, volunteer coordination, and local events</p>
            <a href="mailto:hello@unityserve.org">hello@unityserve.org</a>
        </article>
    </section>

    <section class="section-panel">
        <h2>Why partnership matters</h2>
        <div class="info-grid">
            <article class="info-card">
                <h3>Trusted collaboration</h3>
                <p>Strong partnerships help us surface projects that are organized, relevant, and ready for volunteers to join.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="info-card">
                <h3>Better volunteer experiences</h3>
                <p>Organizations can clearly communicate their needs, which leads to smoother service days and better outcomes for everyone involved.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="info-card">
                <h3>Shared community impact</h3>
                <p>When volunteers and organizations connect effectively, more needs are met and more neighborhoods benefit.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-banner cta-banner--compact">
        <h2>Interested in becoming a partner organization?</h2>
        <p>We help teams highlight their needs, attract volunteers, and communicate project expectations with greater clarity.</p>
        <a href="/about-us" class="btn-primary">Contact Our Team</a>
    </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
